        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-22T13:01:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Aaron Stark\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Aaron Stark:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just got the game and finished reading through the rules. &nbsp;But I have a question about the scenario booklets. &nbsp;Are the scenarios in the booklet meant to be played out as one giant scenario within a single play session?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They certainly can be! And that would be a ton of fun. But you can also play them as stand-alone missions as well. Say your group breaks out the game and just wants to play Omnitron's 2nd scenario. You can totally just jump right into it.</p>",
